{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's time to reap the rewards of your hard work! Expand your dream home and create the perfect living space, more comfortable than ever before. You'll also form deeper connections with your most favorite ladies: the elegant Himari, the gentle Xinyi, and the bold Fumi. Do you have the courage to take your love to the next level\u2014marriage and a life together under one roof?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216840/extras/hires_wedding.gif?t=1732183427\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's not all. A new promising relationship is on the horizon with a girl from the countryside, boasting a fit, toned body and a sun-kissed, alluring complexion. Though she's straightforward, she\u2019s also genuine and carefree, bringing moments of romance and unexpected twists filled with excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216840/extras/Comp_1.gif?t=1732183427\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Light of a New Day' offers you a fresh and fulfilling love story, where every decision leads to unforgettable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bigger and better home apartment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traditional weddings with Himari, Xinyi, or Fumi</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fishing dates with the countryside girl</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New types of fish and dishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216840/extras/dev_mainroom.jpg?t=1732183427\" /></p></li></ul>","b